# {{SYSTEM_NAME}} Screen-Creation Agents — Claude Code Handoff

Orchestration layer for the {{SYSTEM_NAME}} **screen-creation** role agents. This context revolves around
**building consumer screens + coded prototypes** by *consuming* the published {{SYSTEM_NAME}} library. The
**design system itself lives in a separate context** (`{{DS_REPO}}`). Complements — does not
replace — `CONTEXT.md` / `CLAUDE.md` (project facts + working preferences) and `DESIGN.md` (design
principles + benchmarks, shared with the DS context).

---

## Install

`.claude/` (the `product-designer` + `art-director` + `ui-designer` + `flow-reviewer` +
`consumer-migrator` + `data-analyst` agents and the `/design-review`, `/consumer-audit`,
`/art-direction`, `/rebind`, `/usability-report`, `/relayout`, `/checkpoint`, `/changelog` commands)
and `DESIGN.md` are **committed to this repo** — a fresh clone already has the roster, no copy step.
(`/agents` opens an interactive panel inside a terminal Claude Code session to verify.)

The design-system roster (`ds-steward`, `component-designer`, `brand-designer`, `/design-system-check`,
`/binding-audit`, `/drift-check`) is **not here** — it lives in `{{DS_REPO}}`.

